==Etymology==
Squidstrictor's name is a portmanteau of "squid" and "constrictor", referencing his appearance and strength.

==Trivia==
[[File:SquidstrictorPose.png|thumb|2D promotional art of Squidstrictor]]
*In the ''Power of the Omnitrix'' play, Squidstrictor's [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] symbol is positioned sideways, similar to [[Jetray (MAD)|Jetray]] in ''[[Ben 10 Franklin]]''.
**The idea of Omnitrix symbols being positioned sideways would later include those of the [[Omni-Kix Armors]].
*Although some crew members think Squidstrictor is not canon,{{Refn|[[:File:Rocks and Squidstrictor Originally Non-Canon.PNG]]|group = DM}}{{Refn|[[:File:Rocks and Squidstrictor Originally Non-Canon 2.PNG]]|group = MW}} [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] believed Squidstrictor is canon{{Refn|[[:File:Rocks and Squidstrictor Canon.png]]|group = DJW}} and was unlocked off-screen prior to '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]'''.{{Refn|[[:File:Rocks and Squidstrictor Unlocked Before OV.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Had the network allowed the crew to include more aliens into '''Omniverse''', Derrick would have incorporated Squidstrictor.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Wanted to Add Rocks and Squidstrictor Into OV.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick was not aware of Total Access aliens during production.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Had he appeared on-screen, Squidstrictor would have been fairly large and accompanied by the sound of wet noodles.{{Refn|[[:File:Ventrilosquid Size.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:DJW Alien Sound Effects.png]]|group = DJW}}

